# Paper9_FEM3_STYLE_ADAPTED — git scope.
#
# The authoritative Paper9 source-of-truth tree (PROGRAM/paper9, 604 files,
# real NPZ/JSON data) already lives in the repository's git history at commit
# 0f1397b60f709641a0f3389f4ced9a704d61736c (branch phase-1-symbolic).  The
# local uncompressed copy is therefore redundant in git and left untracked.
# The frozen 36 MB source zip duplicates that same tree and is also untracked;
# its small metadata files (FINAL_PACKAGE_AUDIT.md, MANIFEST.sha256,
# references_original_keys.bib) ARE tracked under ORIGINAL/.
/PROGRAM/
/ORIGINAL/Paper9_FINAL_SOURCE_PACKAGE.zip

# HTML preview is live-served and fully regenerable from OVERLEAF/ +
# figures_gen/ (see REPORT/G).  index.html + figure_png/*.png are tracked as a
# self-contained, viewable render; intermediate flat/flat_out/bbl are ignored.
/preview/flat.tex
/preview/flat_out.html
/preview/references.bbl
